        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-005731",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We engage in research and development activities in an effort to introduce new products, enhance existing product effectiveness, improve ease of use and reliability as well as expand the various applications for which our products may be appropriate.",
        "start_character": 8386,
        "end_character": 8636
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-005731",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-005731-03b3110fc0bd2eef",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-005731",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We generate revenue and cash primarily through the design, manufacture, sales and service of solutions for Heating, Ventilation and Air Conditioning (HVAC), transport refrigeration, and custom refrigeration solutions.",
        "start_character": 457,
        "end_character": 674
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-005731",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-005731-03b3110fc0bd2eef",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-005731",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Professional Development – We have numerous online courses in professional development skills as varied as business communication, resiliency, and artificial intelligence (AI), as well as strategic capability initiatives such as product management and other programs that support our strategy of being a world class lean enterprise.",
        "start_character": 23012,
        "end_character": 23345
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-005731",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-005731-03b3110fc0bd2eef",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-005731",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we offer our Trane Technologies people leaders learning programs to develop their skills in leading their teams, such as delivering effective feedback, increasing employee engagement, and coaching.",
