        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As to the latter, we are currently engaged in site investigations and remediation activities to address environmental cleanup from past operations at current and former manufacturing facilities.",
        "start_character": 11542,
        "end_character": 11736
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-005731",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-005731-03b3110fc0bd2eef",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-005731",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also collaborate with organizations such as National Association of Manufacturers, Society for Women Engineers, National Society of Black Engineers, and Society of Hispanic Professional Engineers, that help us recruit qualified talent from varied backgrounds.",
        "start_character": 18744,
        "end_character": 19006
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-005731",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-005731-03b3110fc0bd2eef",
